@startuml Report Generation Sequence

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Report Generation Flow

actor "Business Owner" as Owner
participant "Report Builder" as UI
participant "API Controller" as API
participant "ReportService" as ReportSvc
participant "AnalyticsService" as AnalyticsSvc
participant "ReportGenerator" as Generator
participant "Storage Service" as Storage
participant "ICustomerLoyaltyPlatformContext" as DB
participant "Event Publisher" as Events

Owner -> UI: Open Report Builder
activate UI

Owner -> UI: Configure report\n(type, dates, sections)

Owner -> UI: Click "Generate Report"
UI -> API: POST /api/reports\n{reportConfig}
activate API

API -> ReportSvc: GenerateReport(command)
activate ReportSvc

ReportSvc -> ReportSvc: Create Report entity\n(status: Processing)

ReportSvc -> DB: Save Report
activate DB
DB --> ReportSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

ReportSvc --> API: Report queued\n{reportId}
deactivate ReportSvc

API --> UI: 202 Accepted\n{reportId}
deactivate API

UI --> Owner: "Report generating...\nYou'll be notified when ready"

note right of UI
    Report processing
    happens asynchronously
end note

ReportSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: GetAnalyticsData(period)
activate AnalyticsSvc

AnalyticsSvc -> DB: Query member data
AnalyticsSvc -> DB: Query transaction data
AnalyticsSvc -> DB: Query reward data
AnalyticsSvc --> ReportSvc: AnalyticsData
deactivate AnalyticsSvc

ReportSvc -> Generator: GeneratePDF(data, template)
activate Generator
Generator -> Generator: Render sections
Generator -> Generator: Create charts
Generator -> Generator: Format document
Generator --> ReportSvc: PDF bytes
deactivate Generator

ReportSvc -> Storage: UploadReport(reportId, pdf)
activate Storage
Storage --> ReportSvc: fileUrl
deactivate Storage

ReportSvc -> DB: Update Report\n(status: Completed, fileUrl)
activate DB
DB --> ReportSvc: Updated
deactivate DB

ReportSvc -> Events: Publish(ReportGenerated)
activate Events
Events --> ReportSvc: Published
deactivate Events

Events -> UI: WebSocket notification\n"Report ready"
UI --> Owner: "Your report is ready!\n[Download]"

Owner -> UI: Click Download
UI -> API: GET /api/reports/{id}/download
API --> UI: PDF file stream
UI --> Owner: Report downloaded

@enduml
